/*⁣‌⁠‌‍‌‌​‌‍‌‌‌‌⁠‍⁠⁠⁠​⁠​‌⁠⁠​⁠⁠‍‍‌​‌⁠​​​‌‍⁠‌‌‍‍‍‌‌‍⁠⁠‌​‌‍⁠‍​⁠‌​⁠‌⁠⁠​⁣ =========================================================
   💬 深黑顶栏 · 微信绿气泡 · 锐利高光质感版
   ========================================================= */
:root {
  /* === 全局背景 === */
  --chat-bg-color: #ffffff;

  /* 顶栏基础变量 */
  --chat-header-height: 56px;

  /* 🎯🎯 主标题(备注)设置 🎯🎯 */
  --chat-header-title-color: #333333; /* 配合银灰，字色用纯正深灰 */
  --chat-header-title-size: 17px;
  --chat-header-title-weight: 600;
  --title-top-position: 70%; 

  /* 🎯🎯 自定义副标题设置 🎯🎯 */
  --custom-subtitle-text: "在线"; 
  --custom-subtitle-color: #888888; /* 中灰 */
  --custom-subtitle-size: 11px;
  --custom-subtitle-top: 22px; 

  /* 隐藏系统原生副标题和头像 */
  --chat-header-subtitle-color: transparent;
  --chat-header-subtitle-size: 0px;
  --chat-header-avatar-size: 0px;

  /* === 素净模式布局 === */
  --plain-gap-between-groups: 20px;
  --plain-gap-within-group: 6px;
  --plain-content-max-width: 65%;
  --plain-padding-left-me: 60px;
  --plain-padding-right-me: 0px;
  --plain-padding-left-them: 0px;
  --plain-padding-right-them: 60px;
  --plain-avatar-size: 42px;
  --plain-avatar-radius: 6px;
  --plain-avatar-gap: 10px;

/* =========================================================
   🎯🎯 顶栏定制 (极浅银灰 + 锐利高光) 🎯🎯
   ========================================================= */
.chat-header-custom {
  /* 🎯 极浅的冷灰色渐变 */
  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #ffffff 0%, #f0f0f0 100%) !important;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #d4d4d4 !important;
  /* 🎯 纯白色锐利高光，质感拉满 */
  box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 #ffffff !important; 
  position: relative !important;
}

.chat-header-custom .chat-header-title {
  text-shadow: 0 1px 0 #ffffff !important; /* 纯白下阴影，雕刻感更强 */
  position: absolute !important;
  left: 50% !important;
  top: var(--title-top-position) !important; 
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%) !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  width: max-content !important;
  z-index: 10 !important;
  display: flex !important;
  flex-direction: column !important;
  align-items: center !important;
  overflow: visible !important;
}

.header-avatar-container { display: none !important; }
.chat-header-subtitle { display: none !important; } 

.chat-header-custom .chat-header-title::after {
  content: var(--custom-subtitle-text) !important;
  position: absolute !important;
  top: var(--custom-subtitle-top) !important; 
  left: 50% !important;
  transform: translateX(-50%) !important;
  color: var(--custom-subtitle-color) !important;
  font-size: var(--custom-subtitle-size) !important;
  font-weight: 400 !important;
  white-space: nowrap !important;
}

.header-btn-phone, .header-btn-video { 
  opacity: 0 !important; 
  pointer-events: auto !important; 
}

.header-btn-back svg { display: none !important; }
.header-btn-back::after {
  content: "" !important;
  position: absolute !important;
  left: 16px !important;
  width: 24px !important; 
  height: 24px !important;
  /* 图标换成深灰 */
  background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='%23333333' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><polyline points='15 18 9 12 15 6'/></svg>") !important;
  background-size: contain !important;
  background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
  background-position: center !important;
}

.header-btn-info svg { display: none !important; }
.header-btn-info {
  position: relative !important;
  width: 32px !important;
  height: 32px !important;
}
.header-btn-info::after {
  content: "" !important;
  position: absolute !important;
  inset: 0 !important;
  /* 图标换成深灰 */
  background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='%23333333'><circle cx='5' cy='12' r='2'/><circle cx='12' cy='12' r='2'/><circle cx='19' cy='12' r='2'/></svg>") !important;
  background-size: 24px !important;
  background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
  background-position: center !important;
}

/* ===== 仿微信底栏 (极浅银灰立体质感版 + 顶部间距优化) ===== */
:root {
    /* 基础变量保留，但实际质感由下面的 class 覆盖 */
    --input-area-blur: 0px;
    /* 🎯 核心修改：把第一个数值(顶部间距)从 18px 改成了 10px */
    --input-area-padding: 10px 12px 30px 12px;
    --input-area-min-height: 78px;
    --input-box-color: #1a1a1a;
    --send-btn-radius: 5px;
}

/* 🎯🎯 1. 底栏最外层：注入极浅银灰渐变 + 纯白高光 🎯🎯 */
.input-area-custom {
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #ffffff 0%, #f0f0f0 100%) !important;
    border-top: 1px solid #d4d4d4 !important;
    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 #ffffff !important;
}

.input-row-wrapper {
    display: flex !important;
    align-items: center !important;
    gap: 6px !important;
    width: 100% !important;
}

/* ① 最左 图片 */
.input-btn-plus {
    order: 1 !important;
    width: 34px !important;
    height: 34px !important;
    min-width: 34px !important;
    border: none !important;
    background: transparent !important;
    flex-shrink: 0 !important;
    position: relative !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
}
.input-btn-plus svg, .input-btn-plus img, .input-btn-plus span { display: none !important; }
.input-btn-plus::before {
    content: "" !important;
    position: absolute !important;
    inset: 0 !important;
    background-image: url("https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/08/01/AomAj9uj.png") !important;
    background-size: contain !important;
    background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
    background-position: center !important;
}

/* ② 胶囊容器整体透明 */
.input-action-bar-custom {
    order: 2 !important;
    flex: 1 !important;
    background: transparent !important;
    background-color: transparent !important;
    border: none !important;
    box-shadow: none !important;
    backdrop-filter: none !important;
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: none !important;
    display: flex !important;
    align-items: center !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
}

/* 🎯🎯 3. 输入框白底：注入立体内阴影 + 边缘厚度感 🎯🎯 */
.input-action-bar-custom > *:not(.input-btns-right) {
    flex: 1 !important;
    background: #ffffff !important;
    background-color: #ffffff !important;
    background-image: none !important;
    border: 1px solid #d4d4d4 !important; /* 换成质感灰边框 */
    border-radius: 6px !important;
    /* 注入凹陷阴影和底部白光 */
    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.06), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8) !important; 
    backdrop-filter: none !important;
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: none !important;
    display: flex !important;
    align-items: center !important;
    box-sizing: border-box !important;
}

.input-box-custom {
    flex: 1 !important;
    background: transparent !important;
    background-color: transparent !important;
    background-image: none !important;
    border: none !important;
    box-shadow: none !important;
    backdrop-filter: none !important;
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: none !important;
    color: #1a1a1a !important;
    font-size: 16px !important;
    min-height: 40px !important;
    padding: 9px 40px 9px 12px !important;
    caret-color: #07c160 !important;
    box-sizing: border-box !important;
}
.input-box-custom::placeholder { color: transparent !important; }

/* 按钮组透明，落在白框外 */
.input-btns-right {
    background: transparent !important;
    background-color: transparent !important;
}

/* ③ 麦克风 嵌进白框右侧 */
.input-btn-mic {
    order: 3 !important;
    width: 28px !important;
    height: 28px !important;
    min-width: 28px !important;
    background: transparent !important;
    border: none !important;
    flex-shrink: 0 !important;
    position: relative !important;
    margin-left: -36px !important;
    z-index: 2 !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
}
.input-btn-mic svg, .input-btn-mic img, .input-btn-mic span { display: none !important; }
.input-btn-mic::before {
    content: "" !important;
    position: absolute !important;
    inset: 0 !important;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='%23888888' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M12 1a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v8a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V4a3 3 0 0 0-3-3z'/><path d='M19 10v2a7 7 0 0 1-14 0v-2'/><line x1='12' y1='19' x2='12' y2='23'/></svg>") !important;
    background-size: 17px !important;
    background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
    background-position: center !important;
}

/* ④ 笑脸 图片 (白框外) */
.input-btn-sticker {
    order: 4 !important;
    width: 34px !important;
    height: 34px !important;
    min-width: 34px !important;
    border: none !important;
    background: transparent !important;
    flex-shrink: 0 !important;
    position: relative !important;
    margin-left: 6px !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
}
.input-btn-sticker svg, .input-btn-sticker img, .input-btn-sticker span { display: none !important; }
.input-btn-sticker::before {
    content: "" !important;
    position: absolute !important;
    inset: 0 !important;
    background-image: url("https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/08/01/jwyl8gUo.png") !important;
    background-size: contain !important;
    background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
    background-position: center !important;
}

/* ⑤ 最右 加号 图片 (白框外) */
.input-btn-ai {
    order: 5 !important;
    width: 34px !important;
    height: 34px !important;
    min-width: 34px !important;
    border: none !important;
    background: transparent !important;
    flex-shrink: 0 !important;
    position: relative !important;
    margin-left: 6px !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
}
.input-btn-ai svg, .input-btn-ai img, .input-btn-ai span { display: none !important; }
.input-btn-ai::before {
    content: "" !important;
    position: absolute !important;
    inset: 0 !important;
    background-image: url("https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/08/01/d1ujPYNp.png") !important;
    background-size: contain !important;
    background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
    background-position: center !important;
}

/* 🎯🎯 4. 发送按钮：注入微信绿立体软糖质感 (小巧文字版) 🎯🎯 */
.send-btn-custom {
    order: 6 !important;
    /* 🎯 减小 padding 和固定高度，使其更小巧精致 */
    padding: 5px 12px !important;
    height: 30px !important;
    min-width: 54px !important;
    border-radius: 5px !important;
    margin-left: 6px !important;

    /* 🎯 确保内部文字绝对居中 */
    display: flex !important;
    align-items: center !important;
    justify-content: center !important;

    /* 注入质感 (保持不变) */
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #a8f082 0%, #95ec69 100%) !important;
    border: 1px solid #74d246 !important;
    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.6), 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.05) !important;
    color: #1a1a1a !important; 
    text-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.4) !important;
}

/* 🎯 隐藏原有的纸飞机图标和不需要的元素 */
.send-btn-custom svg, .send-btn-custom img, .send-btn-custom span { 
    display: none !important; 
}

/* 🎯 强行插入“发送”文字 */
.send-btn-custom::after {
    content: "发送" !important;
    font-size: 14px !important; /* 字体稍微调小一点，显得精致 */
    font-weight: 500 !important;
    line-height: 1 !important;
}

/* =========================================================
   🎯🎯 气泡定制 (立体高光质感版：对方灰 / 我方粉) 🎯🎯
   ========================================================= */

/* ── 核心魔法：给气泡加上渐变和纯白高光 ── */
.bubble-me-custom {
  /* 极浅粉色渐变 */
  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #ffffff 0%, #f9e8eb 100%) !important;
  color: #333333 !important;
  padding: 7px 10px !important;
  border-radius: 4px !important;
  border: 1px solid #e8d0d5 !important;
  /* 🎯 顶部纯白高光 + 底部微弱投影 */
  box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 #ffffff, 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.05) !important;
  position: relative !important; 
  overflow: visible !important;
}

.bubble-them-custom {
  /* 极浅灰色渐变 */
  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #ffffff 0%, #f0f0f0 100%) !important;
  color: #333333 !important;
  padding: 7px 10px !important;
  border-radius: 4px !important;
  border: 1px solid #d4d4d4 !important;
  /* 🎯 顶部纯白高光 + 底部微弱投影 */
  box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 #ffffff, 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.05) !important;
  position: relative !important; 
  overflow: visible !important;
}

/* ── 对方气泡: 左侧带描边的小尖角 ── */
/* 外层尖角(灰色描边) */
.bubble-them-custom::before {
  content: "" !important; position: absolute !important; left: -7px !important; top: 12px !important;
  border-top: 6px solid transparent !important; border-bottom: 6px solid transparent !important; 
  border-right: 7px solid #d4d4d4 !important; /* 👈 对应对方边框色 */
  pointer-events: none !important;
}
/* 内层尖角(浅灰底色，取渐变上半部的颜色) */
.bubble-them-custom::after {
  content: "" !important; position: absolute !important; left: -5px !important; top: 13px !important;
  border-top: 5px solid transparent !important; border-bottom: 5px solid transparent !important; 
  border-right: 6px solid #f8f8f8 !important; /* 👈 融合渐变的浅灰色 */
  pointer-events: none !important;
}

/* ── 我方气泡: 右侧带描边的小尖角 ── */
/* 外层尖角(粉色描边) */
.bubble-me-custom::before {
  content: "" !important; position: absolute !important; right: -7px !important; top: 12px !important;
  border-top: 6px solid transparent !important; border-bottom: 6px solid transparent !important; 
  border-left: 7px solid #e8d0d5 !important; /* 👈 对应我方边框色 */
  pointer-events: none !important;
}
/* 内层尖角(浅粉底色，取渐变上半部的颜色) */
.bubble-me-custom::after {
  content: "" !important; position: absolute !important; right: -5px !important; top: 13px !important;
  border-top: 5px solid transparent !important; border-bottom: 5px solid transparent !important; 
  border-left: 6px solid #fdf6f7 !important; /* 👈 融合渐变的浅粉色 */
  pointer-events: none !important;
}

/* =========================================================
   🎵🎵 语音消息终极定制 (同步立体高光质感) 🎵🎵
   ========================================================= */

/* ── 1. 核心魔法：扒掉语音消息的原生气泡外壳 ── */
.msg-bubble-container:has(.voice-msg),
.msg-plain-me:has(.voice-msg),
.msg-plain-them:has(.voice-msg) {
  background: transparent !important;
  border: none !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  padding: 0 !important; 
}

.bubble-me-custom:has(.voice-msg)::before,
.bubble-me-custom:has(.voice-msg)::after,
.bubble-them-custom:has(.voice-msg)::before,
.bubble-them-custom:has(.voice-msg)::after {
  display: none !important;
}

/* ── 2. 暴力破解：砸碎系统的强制换行枷锁！ ── */
.voice-msg {
  display: block !important; 
  width: fit-content !important;
}

.msg-me .voice-msg {
  margin-left: auto !important;
  text-align: right !important; 
}

/* ── 3. 重新给语音条穿上衣服 (同步渐变和高光) ── */
.voice-controls-row {
  display: flex !important;
  align-items: center !important;
  width: fit-content !important; 
  margin-bottom: 2px !important; 
}

/* 我方语音条 (极浅粉 + 高光) */
.msg-me .voice-controls-row {
  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #ffffff 0%, #f9e8eb 100%) !important;       
  border: 1px solid #e8d0d5 !important; 
  box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 #ffffff, 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.05) !important;
  border-radius: 6px !important;
  padding: 10px 14px !important;
  margin-left: auto !important; 
}

/* 对方语音条 (极浅灰 + 高光) */
.msg-them .voice-controls-row {
  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #ffffff 0%, #f0f0f0 100%) !important;       
  border: 1px solid #d4d4d4 !important; 
  box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 #ffffff, 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.05) !important;
  border-radius: 6px !important;
  padding: 10px 14px !important;
}

/* ── 4. 播放按钮、波形、时长 ── */
.voice-play-btn {
  padding: 0 !important;
  width: 15px !important;              
  height: 15px !important;             
  background-color: transparent !important;
  border-radius: 0 !important;
  z-index: 12 !important;
  flex-shrink: 0 !important;
  position: relative !important;       
}
.voice-play-btn svg { display: none !important; }
.voice-play-btn::before {
  content: "" !important;
  position: absolute !important;
  width: 100% !important;             
  height: 100% !important;            
  top: 0 !important;                  
  left: 0 !important;                 
  background-image: url("https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/08/10/zDHKkDTJ.png") !important;
  background-size: contain !important;    
  background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
  background-position: center !important;
}
.voice-waveform {
  opacity: 1 !important;
  margin: 0 8px !important;
  height: 20px !important;
}
.voice-duration {
  color: #6e6e6e !important;
  font-size: 12px !important;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px !important;
}

/* ── 5. 越狱成功的「转文字」文案 (变成行内元素) ── */
.voice-transcription-toggle {
  display: inline-block !important; 
  padding: 0 !important;
  background: transparent !important; 
  font-size: 0 !important; 
  color: transparent !important;
  vertical-align: baseline !important; 
  cursor: pointer !important;
}
.voice-transcription-toggle svg { display: none !important; }

/* 纯文案 */
.voice-transcription-toggle::after {
  content: "点击转文字：" !important;  
  font-size: 13px !important;
  color: #999999 !important;
  font-weight: 500 !important;
}

/* ── 6. 辨识文字 (彻底变成行内文字，死死跟在文案后面) ── */
.voice-transcription {
  display: inline !important; 
  background: transparent !important; 
  border: none !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  margin-left: 2px !important; 
  font-size: 14px !important;
  color: #999999 !important; 
  line-height: 1.5 !important;
  vertical-align: baseline !important;
  text-align: left !important; 
}

/* 覆盖系统可能残留的对齐属性 */
.voice-msg-me .voice-transcription {
  align-self: auto !important;
  margin-left: 2px !important;
}

/* =========================================================
   🎯🎯 微信同款独立翻译气泡 (完美对勾版) 🎯🎯
   ========================================================= */
.msg-translation-wrapper { display: none !important; }
.msg-translation-detached {
    display: block !important; margin-top: 4px !important; max-width: 100% !important;
    width: fit-content !important; min-width: 180px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;
}
.msg-translation-detached-content {
    background: #f0f0f0 !important; color: #1a1a1a !important; padding: 10px 14px 28px 14px !important; 
    border-radius: 6px !important; box-shadow: none !important; font-size: 15px !important;
    line-height: 1.5 !important; word-break: break-word !important; position: relative !important;
    min-width: 180px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;
}
.msg-translation-detached-content::before {
    content: ""; position: absolute; left: 14px; bottom: 8px; width: 14px; height: 14px;
    background-color: #b2b2b2; border-radius: 50%;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='%23f0f0f0' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><polyline points='20 6 9 17 4 12'/></svg>");
    background-size: 10px 10px; background-position: center; background-repeat: no-repeat;
}
.msg-translation-detached-content::after {
    content: "由微信提供翻译支持"; /* 🎯 已替换 */
    position: absolute; left: 34px; bottom: 8px;
    font-size: 11px; color: #b2b2b2; line-height: 14px; pointer-events: none;
}
.msg-translation-detached-them { align-self: flex-start !important; }
.msg-translation-detached-me   { align-self: flex-end !important; }

/* ===== 微信礼物美化 ===== */
:root{
  --gift-card-bg-closed:  #0F4C9B;
  --gift-card-bg-opened:  #7A93BC;
  --gift-text-color-closed: #F5D78A;
